          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitabu sino sili kamakhuwa ke bibiindu nibio Yesu Kristo afuunula. Wele aamuelesia niye lifunulwa lino nio naye ekesie bakholi bewe kamakhuwa kaali siimbi khukhwekholekha, Kristo aakhola bibiindu bino biamanyikha khu mukholi wewe Yoana khulwe khumurumira malaika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala Yoana aaboolile bioosi nibio aabona. Lino nilio liboola liewe khuloondekhana ne burume bubwama khu Wele ne bung'ali bubwafuunulwa ne Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu osoma sitabu sino aabiitwa chikhabi, lundi barekeeresianga kamakhuwa ke bung'oosi bwe burume buno, mala baria kakaandikwa mu sitabu sino babiitwa chikhabi! Sikila siise sie bibiindu bino khukhwekholekha sili siimbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kimileembe khu chikanisa saba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
