    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumwalaalo ne kumuleembe khukhwama khu Wele omenyile mindali, owabao lundi okheeche, khukhwama khu roho saba baali ebweeni we Ndebe yewe eye bubwami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.55.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 55.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.89.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 89.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " lundi khukhwama khu Yesu Kristo omuloli omusuubilwa, owe khunyoa mukhulamusibwa khukhwama mu bafu lundi ooli omuruki owe babaami be sibala bibe nanywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
