            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ese Yoana, wandaayenywe, lundi ooli omuloondi wa Yesu, ese ndi omusaangi wasienywe mu lifwiilisia khulwe khukhwekhaliilikhila siibi sisiichanga khwaabo bali be Bubwami bwewe. Namwaatwa khu sibala sisiakarwa ne kameechi sia Patimo, sikila naba nelwachile elomo eya Wele, ne bung'ali nibwo Yesu afunula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo yo Mwami naba mu Roho, mala naulila kumumilo kwe angaaki kukwauliilikha nga ekhoombi, ne kulomaloma enyuma wase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwaloma kuli, “Aandika mu sitabu niko olikho obona mala oyile mu chikanisa saba mu ngoba chino: Efeso, Simina, Perikamo, Siatira, Sarite, Filatelefia ne Laotikia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
